Design a circuit that detects a rising edge on the input signal 'in' with respect to a clock 'clk'. The module outputs a HIGH signal when a transition from LOW to HIGH occurs on 'in', and sets the output to LOW otherwise. This functionality is useful for synchronizing events based on edges of an input signal in digital circuits.
